{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:516d0b607c2cce5e","name":"Ember of Vahl Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-516d0b607c2cce5e","title":"Ember of Vahl Talent Tree","revision":20145,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:18:06Z","sha256":"90b81c14e1380eb8136e472b7794b9da21f98994a86cfef97779eccf1860f587","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20145","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ember%20of%20Vahl%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-516d0b607c2cce5e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Members of Vahl's cult look to their goddess for inspiration. Over the years, they have developed talents that slant toward the destructive. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Ember of Vahl"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Ember_of_Vahl","referenceId":"reference:e63cea1bc2e37654"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Initiate of Vahl"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Having been formally initiated into Vahl's priesthood, you are resistant to the effects of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," and extreme heat. You take half damage from attacks that deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage, or no damage on a miss (if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage is part of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reading the Flame"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Initiate of Vahl"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can enter a trance by staring into a flame of any size, gaining insight into the workings of the galaxy by meditating on the flame's movement. Whenever you use the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Farseeing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Farseeing","referenceId":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e"}]}," Force Power or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Search Your Feelings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Search_Your_Feelings"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," skill, you can reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Sword of Vahl"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Initiate of Vahl"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your devotion to Vahl allows you to eschew advanced weapons in favor of simple implements of war. You gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," bonus on attack rolls made with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vahl's Brand"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Empower Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Empower_Weapon"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any additional damage you deal with an ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Empowered Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Empowered_Weapon"}]}," is considered to be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Vahl's Flame"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to call forth the sparks of your goddess, wreathing your weapon in flames. Until the beginning of your next turn, any successful attack you make with a melee weapon deals an additional 1d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
